# "{3}{W}: gets +X/+0 where X is its toughness" (CR 611.2a, 608.2h; ruling 2024-04-12): X is read as the ability resolves. With the 0/4
# Armadillo, the ability on the stack and a Giant Growth cast in response (resolving first, 3/7), X is 7 and it becomes 10/7 - not 7/7 from
# the 4 it had on activation. The pump ends with the turn: the Armadillo is 0/4 again on turn 2, and activated once more on turn 3 it is
# 4/4 (not 10/7 or 14/4).

